#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.gt:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``>`` operator (``__gt__``), so ``lf > other`` is equivalent"
" to ``lf.gt(other)`` for non-LiteFrame ``other``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``>`` 运算符（``__gt__``），因此对于非 LiteFrame 的 ``other``，``"
"lf > other`` 等价于 ``lf.gt(other)``。"

